@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/[topic_uuid]/actions/toggle_done/invoke
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamTopicController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "背景表演者\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/stream_topics/{topic_uuid}/actions/toggle_done/invoke
API -> DB: lock canonical TOPIC; toggle is_done;\nversion++, updated_at; append immutable outbox
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: immutable topic_state_projection(outbox_event_uuid)\nscope=(project_id, topic_uuid)
Worker -> Worker: claim exact topic scope + fencing
group 一个 DB transaction
  Worker -> Projection: 选择性 read-only copy 根据 TOPIC
  Worker -> Events: ready topic.updated 对于所有看得见的人来说, users
end
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
@enduml
